[node name="Book" parent="." unique_id=1244758122 node_paths=PackedStringArray("_bookMenu") instance=ExtResource("8_kylad")]
position = Vector2(72, 120)
TranslatedKeyboard = "Press \"t\" to translate weird text like this...

Press and hold W to move up. Press and hold S to move down. Press and hold A to move left. Press and hold D to move right. Press Escape to pause the game."
UntranslatedKeyboard = "Press \"t\" to translate weird text like this...

Bnacc yht rumt F du suja ib. Bnacc yht rumt C du suja tufh. Bnacc yht rumt Y du suja mavd. Bnacc yht rumt T du suja nekrd. Bnacc Aclyba du byica dra kysa."
TranslatedVocal = "Say \"translate\" to translate weird text like this...

Say \"High\" to move up.  Say \"Low\" to move down. Say \"Right\" to move right. Say \"Left\" to move left. Say \"Pause\" to pause the game. Say \"Unpause\" to unpause the game. Say \"Quit\" to quit the game."
UntranslatedVocal = "Say \"translate\" to translate weird text like this...

Cyo \"Ib\" du cdynd sujehk ib. Cyo \"Ib\" ykyeh du cdub sujehk ib. Cyo \"Tufh\" du cdynd sujehk tufh. Cyo \"Tufh\" ykyeh du cdub sujehk tufh. Cyo \"Nekrd\" du cdynd sujehk nekrd. Cyo \"Nekrd\" ykyeh du cdub sujehk nekrd. Cyo \"Mavd\" du cdynd sujehk mavd. Cyo \"Mavd\" ykyeh du cdub sujehk mavd. Cyo \"Byica\" du byica dra kysa. Cyo \"Ihbyica\" du ihbyica dra kysa. Cyo \"Xied\" du xied dra kysa."
TranslatedSound = "Blow long to translate weird text like this...

Hum in a high pitch to start moving up. Hum in a low pitch to start moving down. Whistle in a high pitch to start moving left. Whistle in a high pitch again to stop moving left. Whistle in a low pitch to start moving right. Clap twice to to pause the game. Clap once when paused to unpause the game. Clap twice when paused to quit the game."
UntranslatedSound = "Scratch your computer to translate weird text like this...

Ris eh y rekr bedlr du cdynd sujehk ib. Ris eh y rekr bedlr ykyeh du cdub sujehk ib. Ris eh y muf bedlr du cdynd sujehk tufh. Ris eh y muf bedlr ykyeh du cdub sujehk tufh. Frecdma eh y rekr bedlr du cdynd sujehk mavd. Frecdma eh y rekr bedlr ykyeh du cdub sujehk mavd. Ris eh y muf bedlr du cdynd sujehk nekrd. Ris eh y muf bedlr ykyeh du cdub sujehk nekrd. Chyb ouin vehkanc du byica dra kysa. Chyb ouin vehkanc dfela du xied dra kysa.
"
_bookMenu = NodePath("../CanvasLayer/BookMenu")

